intervals[i].length == 2
0 <= start_i <= end_i <= 10^4', '[{"input":"intervals = [[1, 3], [2, 6], [8, 10], [15, 18]]","output":"[[1, 6], [8, 10], [15, 18]]","explanation":"Since intervals [1, 3] and [2, 6] overlap, merge them into [1, 6]."},{"input":"intervals = [[1, 4], [4, 5]]","output":"[[1, 5]]","explanation":"Intervals [1, 4] and [4, 5] are considered overlapping."}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'https://leetcode.com/problems/merge-intervals/', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2JzRBPFYbKE&list=PLgUwDviBIf0rPG3Ictpu74YWBQ1CaBkm2&index=6', NULL, true, 0, 10, true, 'cmwn97dlj000fo4zikohcyv0n', '2026-11-20T06:28:30.668Z', '2026-11-24T08:12:40.227Z') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
