num consists of only digits.
num does not have any leading zeros not including ''0'' itself.', '[{"input":"num = \"1432219\", k = 3","output":"\"1219\"","explanation":"Remove digits 4, 3, and 2 to form 1219, which is the smallest."},{"input":"num = \"10200\", k = 1","output":"\"200\"","explanation":"Remove the leading 1 and the output is 200 (leading 0s removed)."}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'https://leetcode.com/problems/remove-k-digits/', 'https://youtu.be/jmbuRzYPGrg?si=WN387gwQ7aXWkUao', NULL, true, 0, 20, true, 'cmwnkk8sm000ajqrho65tpyxj', '2026-11-20T06:28:30.708Z', '2026-11-24T08:12:43.715Z') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
